{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkee1UNgWA5N83G5gAPM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Avi, you asked how it went. Here's what I think.\n\n**What I decided:** I'm not doing anything yet. I'll ask you, or the clerk at the bank. I'm only half sure, but this much I understood:\n- **What the account costs:** there's a cheap package the bank has to offer, \"המסלול הבסיסי\", for up to ₪10.00 a month. And from \"01.10.2026\" there's a cap: up to ₪5.00 a month for up to two actions, up to ₪10.00 for up to a hundred. So I need to ask the bank which package I'm on.\n- **How much to keep there:** money that \"עשוי לצאת היום\" (might go out today) stays in the current account. Above \"15,000.00 ₪\" the bank has to send you a notice. I take that to mean the rest shouldn't just sit there.\n- **What stuck with me:** \"10,000 ₪\" in the current account is worth \"8,203 ₪\" in today's money after 10 years. And most banks pay \"0%\" interest on it.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **Screen 1:** the title \"חשבון עובר ושב\" made me feel at home. I read \"מה זה\", about the two packages and the fees.\n2. **Screen 2:** the calculator box \"כמה עולה להשאיר כסף בעו\"ש?\". I didn't touch the slider. The amount was already in a box.\n3. **Screen 3:** the chart I didn't try to read. I read the three numbers underneath: 8,203, 10,779, 2,576.\n4. **Screen 4:** \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\". It says \"אין בישראל ביטוח פיקדונות\", that there's no deposit insurance in Israel. That frightened me, with all our money sitting in deposits.\n5. **Screen 5:** I only glanced at the word list at the end. By then I was tired.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"קרן כספית יומית\" and \"מק\"מ\" mean nothing to me.\n- \"BANK-17\", \"BANK-35\" and those English labels.\n- The little orange circles next to the amounts.\n- \"חוקים וכללים · 5\".\n- On screen 2 the sentence says \"1,797 ₪ פחות\", but further down \"המחיר של להשאיר\" (the cost of leaving it) is \"2,576 ₪\". Which one is the cost?\n- One sentence has both \"מ־01.10.2026\" and \"מ־01.07.2027\". I didn't understand which date applies to what.\n\n**What I couldn't read:** the whole page is dark with grey letters. The small grey lines under the chart and the labels on the axis I couldn't read even enlarged. I didn't open the folds \"חלק מהבנקים כן משלמים ריבית\" and \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\".\n\n**Where I got tired or worried:**\n- The jump from screen 1 to screen 2 is confusing. The section about how much to keep starts in the middle of a sentence.\n- In \"שווה לדעת\" a line is missing between two screens.\n- The deposit insurance part made me anxious.\n\n**What I'd change:** a light background and bigger letters. One clear sentence at the top saying how much a month the account costs and how much to keep in it. No English, and one number for the cost, not two."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1900,"cache_read_input_tokens":11568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1900},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f216b7a-08a5-49c1-b0c8-ea7aab34dd91","uuid":"3491ea4b-dcb1-40fb-8976-796c60824bdb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:29:15.346Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkee1GDxZF1m1uhazmeB"}
